{"id":"vod_sn_35752","vodId":"35752","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"血界战线","name_cn":"血界战线","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9335cf42525a7f9d460ac802f9712179.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为赫尔沙雷姆兹·罗特的虚构城市中，时空扭曲让异世界和人类世界发生了联结，生活在异世界中的古老种族“血界眷属”因此降临，给人类的安全造成了极大的威胁。为了维护世界的和平，一个名为“秘密结社莱布拉”的秘密组织在暗地里活跃地行动着。　　雷欧（阪口大助 配音）本是一个平凡的少年，机缘巧合之下，他误打误撞加入了莱布拉，成为了惩奸除恶的一份子，继而结识了外表粗犷内心温柔的克劳斯（小山力也 配音）、个性开朗油嘴滑舌的扎普（中井和哉 配音）和外表普通实则是狼人的钱皇（小林优 配音）等人。这些志同道合的好友让雷欧的生活拉开了别样的序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9bfQDz50uB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VstDbcU7uz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HdSjcqWUEE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/49s0SgHP4y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WtJrGkmDUe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Gcejq5TFY71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZzF7yBfYsR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gDm0NNv6tz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gPWYZS32Yk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JVX5xcySC41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1BERfxPJAc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p0aiNW19cB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q3mDJYbzUk1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:31.110Z"}